# Mihr UI Flutter - Project Rules

## Architecture

This project is a Flutter UI component library. It uses Flutter's native `ThemeData` and `ThemeExtension` system — no external theme packages.

### Layer Structure

```
1. Primitives (ColorScale, static values)
   └── Base color palettes, spacing, radius, shadow constants

2. Semantic Tokens (ThemeExtension classes)
   └── TextColors, BackgroundColors, BorderColors, ForegroundColors
   └── Different values for light/dark mode

3. Components (Widgets)
   └── MihrPrimaryButton, MihrSecondaryButton, MihrBadge, etc.
   └── Read colors ONLY via semantic tokens from context
```

